These assets may be used to:

  - Refer to Specful in editorial, journalistic or educational material.
  - Link to the Specful project.
  - Identify an unmodified distribution of Specful.

These assets may not be used to:

  - Identify another product, service or software project.
  - Suggest sponsorship, endorsement or affiliation that does not exist.
  - Sell merchandise bearing the marks without prior written permission.

If you fork Specful and rebrand it, replace these marks with your own. The
licences covering the remaining contents of this repository do not grant rights
to use these marks outside the permissions above.

For permissions beyond these terms, contact the project owner through the
Specful repository.
